---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us & Clinical Methodology - Cosmetiqly" description="Learn about Cosmetiqly's medical advisory board, INCI ingredient parsing methodology, and open-source scientific data sources.">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 md:py-16">
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-slate-400 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-rose-400">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-rose-400 font-semibold">About Us</span>
    </nav>

    <div class="mb-10 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-400 mb-3">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse"></span>
        Medical & Scientific E-E-A-T Standards
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold font-outfit text-white tracking-tight">
        About <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-rose-400 via-pink-400 to-purple-400">Cosmetiqly</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 mt-3 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        The gold-standard programmatic database for dermatological INCI cosmetic safety, ingredient trigger analysis, and clinical formulation evaluation.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- E-E-A-T Mission & Methodology Cards -->
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-outfit text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">🔬</span> Our Clinical Mission & Purpose
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Cosmetiqly was founded to solve a major consumer problem: skincare product labels are filled with complex INCI (International Nomenclature of Cosmetic Ingredients) terms that are difficult for consumers with specific skin conditions to decipher.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Whether you suffer from Fungal Acne (Malassezia folliculitis), severe Rosacea, pore-clogging comedogenicity, or are navigating obstetric safety during pregnancy, Cosmetiqly provides instant, rule-based ingredient verification across **1,000,000+ safety checks** and **67,000+ cosmetic formulations**.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-outfit text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">📚</span> Authoritative Scientific & Data Sources
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Cosmetiqly's rule engine evaluates product formulations against verified peer-reviewed dermatological studies and official regulatory databases, including:
        </p>
        <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <li class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> Open Beauty Facts (INCI Database)
          </li>
          <li class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> US FDA Voluntary Cosmetic Registration
          </li>
          <li class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> PubMed & National Institutes of Health (NIH)
          </li>
          <li class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> CIR (Cosmetic Ingredient Review) Panels
          </li>
          <li class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> EWG Skin Deep Database Benchmarks
          </li>
          <li class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-bold">✓</span> European SCCS Safety Committees
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/80 border border-slate-800 shadow-xl">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-outfit text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="text-2xl">⚖️</span> Medical Disclaimer & Editorial Integrity
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Cosmetiqly operates as an educational and research database tool. Our automated INCI parsing engine uses strict mathematical pattern matching to flag blacklisted ingredients based on published scientific literature.
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed italic">
          Disclaimer: Information provided on Cosmetiqly does not constitute medical advice or a formal physician diagnosis. Consumers with severe skin disorders, allergies, or obstetric concerns should always consult a board-certified dermatologist or healthcare provider before introducing new products into their routine.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
